      "id": 60731,
      "name": "Season 1",
      "overview": "The mythical city of Camelot, in a time before history began, is a fantastical realm of legendary beasts and mysterious peoples. In this dangerous world, magic has been banned by the ruthless tyrant; Uther Pendragon. Merlin, a young man gifted with extraordinary magical powers, arrives at the gates of Camelot, sent by his mother to start a new life. Though bright-eyed with wonder, the young sorcerer quickly makes enemies, including the heir to Uther\u0027s crown, the headstrong Prince Arthur.",
      "poster_path": "/ppIGf4msLHnyyaOFbxu8De3h7BY.jpg",
      "season_number": 1
    },
    {
      "air_date": "2009-09-19T00:00:00-07:00",
      "episode_count": 13,
      "id": 60727,
      "name": "Season 2",
      "overview": "The second series of Merlin finds Camelot more vulnerable than ever to the dark forces of magic, forcing Merlin to make difficult decisions in order to protect Arthur, ensure the future king\u0027s survival and prevent the mythic kingdom from being destroyed.",
